    <Title>Deploy - Windows Management Framework - 4.0 - Windows</Title>
    <Description><![CDATA[<P>Deploys Windows Management Framework 4.0.</P>
<P>Requires .Net 4.5</P>]]></Description>
    <Relevance>windows of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance>/* Must be Windows 7 SP1 or  or Windows Server 2008 R2 SP1 */  (version of it equals &quot;6.1&quot; as version and service pack major version of it = 1) of operating system</Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[/* Must have .Net Framework 4.5 installed */ (value "Version" of key "client" of it as string as version >= "4.5" as version) of key "Microsoft\Net Framework Setup\NDP\v4" of key "HKLM\Software" of x64 registry]]></Relevance>
    <Relevance><![CDATA[/* Only run if powershell 4.0 or above not already installed */ not exists value "PowerShellVersion" whose (it as string as version >= "4.0" as version) of keys "HKLM\Software\Microsoft\Powershell\3\PowerShellEngine" of native registry]]></Relevance>
